OL,3,GNEWSA'We can finally plan our future':
OL,4,AJoy as #2.2bn Ladywood scheme axed
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor five years, Layla Al-Abhar has been
OL,7,Funable to think about making
OL,8,Fimprovements to her home, fearing it
OL,9,Fwas going to be demolished.
OL,11,FBut after news the #2.2bn masterplan to
OL,12,Fregenerate Ladywood has collapsed, her
OL,13,Fmind is whirring with decorating plans.
OL,15,FAl-Abhar, from campaign group Ladywood
OL,16,FUnite, said her family feared they
OL,17,Fcould be forced to leave their home and
OL,18,Frent if the plans went ahead, while
OL,19,Fyears of uncertainty had left many
OL,20,Fresidents reluctant to invest in their
OL,21,Fproperties.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
